    text   .dim1   |L 10 | at x1   ymax call |!this.drawaids()| width 9  is REAL format !!distanceFmt
    text   .dim2   |L 11 | at xmin ymax call |!this.drawaids()| width 9  is REAL format !!distanceFmt
