    text   .dim8   | L 17 | at xmin ymax call |!this.drawaids()| width 9  is REAL format !!distanceFmt
    text   .dim9   | L 18 | at xmin ymax call |!this.drawaids()| width 9  is REAL format !!distanceFmt
    text   .dim10  | L 19 | at xmin ymax call |!this.drawaids()| width 9  is REAL format !!distanceFmt

