    text   .dim13  | L 22 | at xmin ymax call |!this.drawaids()| width 9  is REAL format !!distanceFmt
    text   .dim14  | L 23 | at xmin ymax call |!this.drawaids()| width 9  is REAL format !!distanceFmt
    text   .dim15  | L 24 | at xmin ymax call |!this.drawaids()| width 9  is REAL format !!distanceFmt

    text   .dim16  | L 25 | at xmax ymin.dim1 call |!this.drawaids()| width 9  is REAL format !!distanceFmt
    text   .dim17  | L 26 | at xmin ymax call |!this.drawaids()| width 9 is REAL format !!distanceFmt
